{"id": "404296", "name": "משיק ל-ln(ln(ln x)) ב-x=eᵏ – חיתוך עם ציר y", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ell(x)\\)</span> את הישר המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\ln(\\ln(\\ln(x))) \\]</p><p>מעל הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0=e^{{{CT:0}}}.\\)</span> מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ell(0)\\)</span>, כלומר את החיתוך של ישר זה עם ציר ה-y (רשמו את הערך המדויק).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\ell(0) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מוצאים את נקודת ההשקה ואת השיפוע (כלל השרשרת), כותבים את משוואת המשיק ומציבים בה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — נקודת ההשקה</b><br><p>מכיוון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln(e^{{{CT:0}}})={{CT:0}}\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(e^{{{CT:0}}})=\\ln(\\ln {{CT:0}}) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — השיפוע</b><br><p>לפי כלל השרשרת (פעמיים):</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)=\\frac{1}{\\ln(\\ln x)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ln x}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x} \\]</p><p>ובנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0=e^{{{CT:0}}}\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(e^{{{CT:0}}})=\\frac{1}{\\ln {{CT:0}}\\cdot {{CT:0}}\\cdot e^{{{CT:0}}}}=\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}e^{{{CT:0}}}\\ln {{CT:0}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — החיתוך עם ציר y</b><br><p>משוואת המשיק היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ell(x)=f(x_0)+f'(x_0)\\,(x-x_0)\\)</span>. מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=0\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ell(0)=f(e^{{{CT:0}}})-e^{{{CT:0}}} f'(e^{{{CT:0}}})=\\ln(\\ln {{CT:0}})-\\frac{e^{{{CT:0}}}}{{{CT:0}}e^{{{CT:0}}}\\ln {{CT:0}}}=\\ln(\\ln {{CT:0}})-\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}\\ln {{CT:0}}} \\]</p><p>כלומר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ell(0)={{CT:1}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log(log(k))+1/(k*log(k))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>בדקו את הסימן: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ell(0)=f(x_0)+f'(x_0)\\,(0-x_0)=f(x_0)-x_0f'(x_0)\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log(log(k))-%e^k/(k*log(k))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>בכלל השרשרת חסר הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span>, הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln x\\)</span> הפנימי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log(log(k))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<p>זה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x_0)\\)</span>, הערך בנקודת ההשקה. החיתוך עם ציר y הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ell(0)=f(x_0)-x_0f'(x_0)\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "tans1"], "nvariants": 5}